--! A test platform's one capability: make every later `fetch` fail with an
--! error the Fetch standard does not document — a `RangeError` — which no
--! program can arrange by itself (`boundary.md` §4.1, §9.8.10 (c)).


--| From now on, every `fetch` rejects with a `RangeError`.
pub foreign impure breakFetch : () -> ()
